{"title":"1992 AIME Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AIME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Faces <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/7/a57d96e9f1cd9a6d57c7cdf6eee5f3dfc2ef43a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC^{}_{}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"45\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/5/605bb989ed4e4202d454e7cdda71a1e020d1dd2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BCD^{}_{}$\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" /> of tetrahedron <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/f/42f7cf27c522dbcdf92907b546e9ed1ca69f75c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD^{}_{}$\" width=\"57\" height=\"13\" /> meet at an angle of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/9/919bf5d461970fc8d905d63704ef763c08594184.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30^\\circ$\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" />. The area of face <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/7/a57d96e9f1cd9a6d57c7cdf6eee5f3dfc2ef43a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC^{}_{}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"45\" height=\"19\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/c/08cbf4237f1b3d0f5cb2736a9efcdf996aa52869.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120^{}_{}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />, the area of face <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/5/605bb989ed4e4202d454e7cdda71a1e020d1dd2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BCD^{}_{}$\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/6/7d6d50ae0c10b83af2751a4de565ea214afcdd54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80^{}_{}$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/7/d77bcbd14f6186ca0a1fede13b2f6f23a59c140f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC=10^{}_{}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" />. Find the volume of the tetrahedron.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AIME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the area <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/8/908311c22c0b6b77d64c0352d1d53239fc955161.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BCD=80=\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot10\\cdot16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"186\" height=\"37\" />, the perpendicular from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> has length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>The perpendicular from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3379c269043e225d860794fc79d0a220704b61e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16 \\cdot \\sin 30^\\circ=8$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"115\" height=\"13\" />. Therefore, the volume is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/a/7fade81596dd14722fe149eed0ec5429c1112743.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{8\\cdot120}{3}=\\boxed{320}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"116\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AIME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> is 120 and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />=10, the slant height is 24. Height from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/a/d7ada763e99852a6e44a15d46cce3c3709a944d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/0/2b0b436d3f832719d26da08d34976323c75a24db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24 \\cdot \\sin 30^\\circ=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"127\" height=\"15\" />. Since area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/a/d7ada763e99852a6e44a15d46cce3c3709a944d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> is 80, the volume of tetrahedron <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" />= <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/6/1e6b06fc17e0445891ac637b9a609d4a0096e280.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{80\\cdot12}{3}=\\boxed{320}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"118\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AIME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AIME\" title=\"1992 AIME\">1992 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1992 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1992 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1992\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1992 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1992 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1992 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AIME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1992 AIME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1992 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1992 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1992 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1992 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1992 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AIME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1992 AIME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AIME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1992 AIME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AIME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1992 AIME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AIME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1992 AIME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AIME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1992 AIME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AIME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1992 AIME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AIME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1992 AIME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017001026\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 201/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1766/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 88/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4365/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.964      1 -total\n 57.93%    7.510      1 Template:AIME_box\n 40.44%    5.242      1 Template:MA